				"| 标签            | 含义                                | 典型写法                                                                    |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `<Subject N>` | 可复用的**可见内容**（人/动物/物体/场景/服装/风格/动作） | `<Subject 1> is the young woman in <Picture 1>, with long dark hair...` |\n| `<Picture N>` | 用作**具体目标帧/构图锚点**的参考图（首帧/关键帧/末帧）   | `<Picture 2> is the first frame of [Shot 1], showing a woman seated...` |\n| `<Video N>`   | 整视频层面的关系：剪辑源、续接起点、镜头运动/节奏来源       | `<Video 1> is the source video for the target video edit.`              |\n| `<Audio N>`   | 被复制/参考的音频信号（BGM、音色、对白、音效）         | `<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 1> (S1).`         |\n"
