		{
			"outputs":[
				
			],
			"color":"#222",
			"widgets_values":[
				"**起手：关键帧对齐：** \n- **I2VA（首帧）：**  \n  `For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.`\n- **FL2VA（首+末帧）：**  \n  `How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot N) aligns with the 8.00-second mark of the target video.`\n- **L2VA（仅末帧）：**  \n  `How the reference pictures align with the target video — <Picture 1> (from [Shot N]) aligns with the 6.00-second mark of the target video.`\n\n**易错强调：** T2VA 没有这行，直接写三段；I2VA/FL2VA/L2VA 缺这行 = 模型不知道图该落在哪。\n\n**三段式** \n```\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] ...\noverall_soundscape: ...\nnon_diegetic_music: ...\n```\n\n- `integrated_multimodal_description`：沿时间线写画面+动作+镜头+说话者+对白+画内音。\n- `overall_soundscape`：1–4 句总结环境声/物理动作声/非语言人声（对白已在上段，不重复）。无声音用 `N/A`。\n- `non_diegetic_music`：1–3 句描述「只有观众能听到」的配乐（乐器、速度、动态）。无则用 `N/A`。\n\n**镜头写法三要素：** 运动类型 + 幅度 + 速度，写成自然英文动作句，别堆标签。\n\n```\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide shot frames a baker...\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to a close-up of steam rising...\nThe camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward the letter.\n```\n"
			],
